          "properties": {
            "text": {
              "expr": {
                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'Shows the total recorded distance for each origin-destination pair, regardless of travel direction.\n\nCalculated as the sum of trip distances assigned to each route pair.\n\nRoutes are ranked by total distance traveled. A higher value may result from more frequent trips, longer individual trips, or both.\n\nEach recorded trip is counted separately. Opposite travel directions are grouped for analysis but are not combined into round trips.'"
